@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
title Scenario - interrupted organization and evidence-based recovery
autonumber
participant "Dowlume\n(domain boundary)" as Dowlume
participant "Operation\norganizeReport" as Operation
participant "Recorded source\nD/report.pdf" as Source
participant "Recorded destination\nD/Documents/report.pdf" as Destination
participant "Downloaded File\nreport" as File
note over Operation, File
  Organize was recorded as Pending before interruption.
  Its intended after condition says Organized, with fingerprint H-report.
  A separate tracked file record may not yet exist.
end note
[-> Dowlume : retry interrupted operations
Dowlume -> Operation : examine recorded intent and evidence needed
Operation --> Dowlume : source, destination, expected content, intended condition
Dowlume -> Source : inspect presence and content when present
Source --> Dowlume : observed source facts
Dowlume -> Destination : inspect presence and content when present
Destination --> Dowlume : observed destination facts
alt only destination exists and matches H-report
  Dowlume -> Operation : confirm Completed with intended after facts
  Dowlume -> File : recognize Organized at recorded destination
  note over Operation, File : One logical confirmation; no second move is requested.
else only source exists and matches H-report
  Dowlume -> Operation : record Failed: original action did not finish
  Dowlume -->[ : original action may be retried as a new Operation
else both exist, neither exists, content differs, or inspection fails
  Dowlume -> Operation : record NeedsAttention
  Dowlume -->[ : show locations for inspection; block affected file/path
  note over Source, Destination : Preserve any existing copies. Do not select one to delete.
end
legend bottom
  D abbreviates the fictional Downloads Folder. Source and destination are location roles, not software components.
  This scenario concerns Organize. An interrupted Recycle cannot be confirmed from source disappearance alone.
endlegend
@enduml
